  width `≤ W`, `N` records in the unit disk) that represents `xs`, `code` leaves an array
  representing `T xs` (scale `p`, width `≤ W`, `N` records in the disk), at cost `≤ cost`.
* **`twist_run`**: the `J_E` pass of a round: the exponent table (`tabP`, `KFV3Tab`) and the
  per-record negacyclic rotation (`twC`, `KFV2Tw`), cost `cTab + cTw`.
* `LayerOK.twist` / `LayerOK.twistPre`: a layer followed / preceded by a twist pass;
  `LayerOK.comp`: sequential composition.
-/

set_option linter.unusedSectionVars false
set_option linter.unusedSimpArgs false
set_option linter.unusedVariables false

